  kind: 1
  title: Potato and Onion Hash
  recipe: {fileID: 0}
  body: '(stand-in until Grandma''s own card is added)


    Potato and Onion Hash


    Two
    potatoes and an onion, sliced

    An egg if the hens are laying

    A pinch
    of salt


    Fry it all together in the skillet. Feeds two.'
  marginNote: A good way to use the soft potatoes before they turn.
